    "body": "As I said, I'm still not sure if I mixed things up somewhere\n\nfrom my understanding, at step 1 things are like that : `target node` is `table`, current node is `td`, scope list contains `html`, `table` and `template`\n\nstep 2 does not apply because `td` != `table`\nstep 3 does because `table` is included in scope list so returns failure. \n\nI'm I missing something ?\n",
